  "interpretation": "The publisher and independent reader continued receiving poses while EGO had no successful take. The callback thread showed little runnable wait and was sampled sleeping on its UDP receive wait channel for nearly the whole gap, which weighs against sustained scheduler starvation. The EGO UDP socket drop counter increased by 171 across the bracket, including 154 between the first and last samples inside the gap, while sampled receive queue occupancy remained zero. Linux exposes this as a socket-level drop counter; this participant socket also carries other DDS traffic. The observation is consistent with receive-side socket pressure but does not prove the drops were camera-pose packets or caused this take gap. Exact effective SO_RCVBUF was not measured.",
